msgstr "100 % inspection"

msgid ""
"Si la muestra de la tabla es igual o mayor que el lote, la norma manda "
"inspeccionar todo el lote. El plan devuelto lleva `n = N` (con el `Ac` de"
" la tabla) y se avisa con un `UserWarning`; antes devolvía la muestra de "
"la tabla aunque no cupiera en el lote (un error)."
msgstr ""
"If the table sample is equal to or larger than the lot, the standard "
"calls for inspecting the whole lot. The returned plan has `n = N` (with "
"the table `Ac`) and a `UserWarning` is emitted; before, it returned the "
"table sample even if it did not fit in the lot (a bug)."

msgid "Muestreo doble"
msgstr "Double sampling"

msgid ""
"Con `sampling=\"double\"` se usa la tabla III-A (inspección normal): una "
"primera muestra `n1` y, si no basta para decidir, una segunda `n2`. Se "
"acepta con la primera si hay `ac1` defectuosos o menos, se rechaza con "
"`re1` o más y, entre ambos, se toma la segunda y se acepta si el total es"
" `ac2` o menos (`re2 = ac2 + 1`)."
msgstr ""
"With `sampling=\"double\"` table III-A (normal inspection) is used: a "
"first sample `n1` and, if it is not enough to decide, a second `n2`. The "
"lot is accepted with the first sample if there are `ac1` defectives or "
"fewer and rejected with `re1` or more; in between, the second sample is "
"taken and the lot is accepted if the total is `ac2` or fewer (`re2 = ac2 "
"+ 1`)."

msgid ""
"No hay plan doble para AQL 0,010 y 0,015 % (`ValueError`) y la letra A "
"usa el plan de la letra B (con aviso). La inspección rigurosa y reducida "
"y el muestreo múltiple no están incluidos. Las tablas I, II-A y III-A se "
"transcribieron de capturas de la norma, no de su texto."
msgstr ""
"There is no double plan for AQL 0.010 and 0.015 % (`ValueError`) and "
"letter A uses the plan of letter B (with a warning). Tightened and "
"reduced inspection and multiple sampling are not included. Tables I, II-A"
" and III-A were transcribed from screenshots of the standard, not from "
"its text."

msgid "Por variables — MIL-STD-414"
msgstr "By variables — MIL-STD-414"

msgid ""
"Usa la media y desviación estándar de la muestra para decidir con el "
"método del factor de aceptabilidad `k`: se acepta si `Q = (U − x̄)/s ≥ k`"
" (o `(x̄ − L)/s ≥ k`). Los planes salen de las tablas A-2 (letra de "
"código por tamaño de lote y nivel de inspección I a V) y B-1 (`n` y `k` "
"por letra y AQL) de **MIL-STD-414 (11 de junio de 1957)**, método de la "
"desviación estándar, especificación unilateral, Forma 1."
msgstr ""
"It uses the sample mean and standard deviation to decide with the "
"acceptability constant method `k`: the lot is accepted if `Q = (U − x̄)/s"
" ≥ k` (or `(x̄ − L)/s ≥ k`). Plans come from tables A-2 (code letter by "
"lot size and inspection level I to V) and B-1 (`n` and `k` by letter and "
"AQL) of **MIL-STD-414 (11 June 1957)**, standard-deviation method, single"
" specification limit, Form 1."

msgid ""
"No es ANSI/ASQ Z1.9: sus tablas no están disponibles (`standard=\"z1.9\"`"
" lanza `ValueError`). Las tablas de MIL-STD-414 se transcribieron de "
"capturas de la norma, no de su texto, y no se comprobó que coincidan con "
"Minitab ni con Z1.9. La Forma 2, la inspección reducida, el método del "
"rango y la doble especificación no están incluidos: para una doble "
"especificación dé su plan con `n=` y `k=`. Si el `n` de la tabla es igual"
" o mayor que el lote, se inspecciona todo el lote (`n = N`) con un aviso."
msgstr ""
"It is not ANSI/ASQ Z1.9: its tables are not available "
"(`standard=\"z1.9\"` raises `ValueError`). The MIL-STD-414 tables were "
"transcribed from screenshots of the standard, not from its text, and were"
" not checked against Minitab or Z1.9. Form 2, reduced inspection, the "
"range method and two-sided specifications are not included: for a two-"
"sided specification give your plan with `n=` and `k=`. If the `n` of the "
"table is equal to or greater than the lot size, the whole lot is "
"inspected (`n = N`) with a warning."

