msgid ""
"La probabilidad de aceptación de un plan unilateral es exacta "
"(distribución t no central: `Pa = P(t'(n−1; z·√n) ≥ k·√n)`), con datos "
"normales e independientes. La curva OC bilateral supone el proceso "
"centrado entre los límites."
msgstr ""
"The acceptance probability of a one-sided plan is exact (noncentral t "
"distribution: `Pa = P(t'(n−1; z·√n) ≥ k·√n)`), with normal, independent "
"data. The two-sided OC curve assumes the process is centered between the "
"limits."

