#, python-format
msgid ""
"La probabilidad de aceptación (LTPD, AOQL y ATI) se calcula con la "
"distribución **binomial** (curva OC tipo B), no con la hipergeométrica de"
" un lote finito aislado (tipo A), que daría una ``Pa`` algo menor y, con "
"ella, planes algo distintos (``N = 1000``, ``n = 132``, ``c = 3`` y 5 % "
"defectuosos: binomial 0,0992 frente a hipergeométrica 0,0838)."
msgstr ""
"The acceptance probability (LTPD, AOQL and ATI) is computed with the "
"**binomial** distribution (type B OC curve), not with the hypergeometric "
"of an isolated finite lot (type A), which would give a slightly lower "
"``Pa`` and, with it, somewhat different plans (``N = 1000``, ``n = 132``,"
" ``c = 3`` and 5 % defective: binomial 0.0992 versus hypergeometric "
"0.0838)."

